      <div class="max-w-5xl w-full">
        <div class="my-8 grid grid-cols-5 text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl">
          <p class="col-span-5 lg:col-span-3">
            hey! i'm sam liu!<br />
            <br />
            i'm a recent high school graduate who is taking a gap-year to help teens
            learn how to code @ <a href="https://hackclub.com" target="_blank"
              >hack club</a
            ><br />
            <br />
            i love building random shenanigans and exploring out-of-the-box ideas<br
            />
            <br />
            i'm excited about...<br />
            - crafting code (this page for example)<br />
            - robotics (i did frc for 4 years)<br />
            - bringing people together (events & meetups)<br />
            - documenting moments (writing & video)<br />
            - design (still needs a lot of work)<br />
            - silly adventures<br />
            - ???<br />
            <br />
            if any of these sound interesting, <a href="/contact">reach out</a
